sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Platform Admin
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Reconciler as LLMBatchGatewayReconciler
    participant Helm as Helm v3 Library<br/>(In-Process)
    participant RefGrant as ReferenceGrant<br/>(Source Namespace)
    participant Prom as Prometheus
    participant MetricsEP as Operator Metrics<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over User,MetricsEP: Flow 1: LLMBatchGateway Reconciliation
    User->>K8sAPI: Create/Update LLMBatchGateway CR
    K8sAPI->>Reconciler: Watch event (SA token auth)
    Reconciler->>Reconciler: Validate spec, resolve images from env vars
    Reconciler->>Helm: Render batch-gateway chart with CR values
    Helm-->>Reconciler: Rendered K8s resources
    Reconciler->>Helm: Render async-processor chart (if dispatchMode=async)
    Helm-->>Reconciler: Rendered K8s resources
    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Server-Side Apply rendered resources<br/>(Deployments, Services, ConfigMaps, RBAC)
    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Delete orphaned resources (spec changes)
    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Update LLMBatchGateway status conditions

    Note over User,MetricsEP: Flow 2: Cross-Namespace Secret Resolution
    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: List ReferenceGrants in source namespace
    K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: ReferenceGrants
    Reconciler->>Reconciler: Verify authorization via ReferenceGrant
    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Get Secret from source namespace
    K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: Secret data
    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: SSA Secret copy into CR namespace
    Reconciler->>Reconciler: Mark secretRef as immutable

    Note over User,MetricsEP: Flow 3: Operator Self-Monitoring
    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: SSA Service, ServiceMonitor, PrometheusRule
    Prom->>MetricsEP: GET /metrics<br/>Bearer token + SubjectAccessReview
    MetricsEP-->>Prom: Metrics (TLS via service-ca cert)
